# w8fix-place W8-03-01 [RE: CellClass::CanThisExistHere FUN_0047C530 via the
# MCV legality FUN_007154F0; try-to-deploy ring FUN_00737D50]: May Day
# (xmp31s2). An MCV ordered to deploy in the middle of the ore field never
# unfolds on ore: it drives to the first legal ring offset or reports
# "cannot deploy". Every structure of house 0 stands on buildable cells
# (bad_place: overlay / ore / slope / bridge / unbuildable land).
set render_every 0
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button Skirmish
require scene == lobby
click button "Customize Battle"
require page == "Customize Battle"
click list:down
click list:down
click map:xmp31s2.map
click button "Use Map"
require map == "xmp31s2.map"
click start
until 90 scene == game
require scene == game
click unit 0:AMCV
key d
until 450 built(0,GACNST) == 1
assert bad_place(0) == 0
cheat spawn AMCV 0 cell 112 95
wait 3
click unit 0:AMCV:0
wait 1
require selected == 1
key d
wait 450
assert bad_place(0) == 0
log mcv-on-ore
dump
end
